      en: ["Bumba is located at the northernmost point of the Congo River bend.", "The town is the terminus of the Vicicongo narrow-gauge railway.", "The port of Bumba is one of the busiest on the upper Congo River.", "Large rice and palm oil plantations are located in the vicinity.", "Bumba is served by its own airport (IATA code: BMB).", "The town is situated about 450 kilometers upstream from Mbandaka."],
